# Recommended Testing Strategy

Do not implement everything at once.

Use the following order:

    1. Implement normal BST insert()
                  |
                  v
       Test using search()
                  |
                  v
    2. Implement normal BST remove()
                  |
                  v
       Test using search()
                  |
                  v
    3. Add leftSize maintenance
                  |
                  v
       Test using at()

Testing the implementation in stages makes it easier to identify whether
a problem comes from the BST structure or from incorrect `leftSize`
values.
